# Signed release APKs staged for upload (~11MB each). Built locally via
# `assembleRelease` and uploaded by hand to the GitHub Release; never belongs
# in git history. NCC and StudyDesk have ignored this path since v1.9 — LimeLog
# was the only one of the three that did not.
/release/

# Signing credentials for the shared Limecore release keystore.
# Must never be committed - the whole suite is signed with one key.
keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore
